  "description": "Word (.docx) generation and text extraction for GM.Documents. Generates documents (contracts, KYC verification letters, formatted correspondence) from GM.Documents' library-neutral DocumentContent block model via the Open XML SDK, and extracts text from existing .docx files — behind IDocumentGenerator<WordDocumentDefinition> and IDocumentTextExtractor. Open XML types never leak to consumers. Register with AddGMDocuments().AddWord(). Open XML SDK is MIT-licensed.",
